---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Casos d'Èxit · Informes Pericials Resolts"
description: "Selecció d'expedients pericials reals en edificació, obra civil i assegurances. Patologies documentades, quanties peritades i resultats obtinguts per als nostres clients."
lang: ca
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Casos
  order: 3
translations:
  - lang: es
    permalink: /casos-exito/
  - lang: en
    permalink: /en/success-cases/
permalink: "/ca/casos-d-exit/"
---
{% set ui = ca %}
{% set heroTitle = "Casos d'Èxit<br>en Peritatge" %}
{% include "partials/page-hero.njk" %}
<section itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/CollectionPage" style="max-width: var(--container-wide); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--section-y) var(--gutter);">
<meta itemprop="name" content="{{ title }}">
<meta itemprop="description" content="{{ description }}">
<div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:var(--fs-mono-label);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label);text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:var(--fw-medium);color:var(--text-accent);margin-bottom:clamp(28px,4vw,48px);"><span style="width:24px;height:1.5px;background:var(--accent);display:inline-block;"></span>— § 04 · Expedients ratificats</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px;" class="three-col">
{% for caso in casosExito_ca %}
{% if caso.estado == "publicado" %}
<a href="/ca/casos-d-exit/{{ caso.slug }}/" style="text-decoration:none;display:block;" itemprop="hasPart" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
<article style="border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid {{ 'var(--ink-700)' if loop.index % 3 == 2 else 'var(--border-hairline)' }}; background: {{ 'var(--surface-ink)' if loop.index % 3 == 2 else 'var(--surface-card)' }}; padding: 24px; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display:flex; flex-direction:column;">
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px;">
<div style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;">{% for tag in caso.tags | slice(0, 2) %}<span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:var(--fs-mono-label);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label);text-transform:uppercase;color:{{ 'var(--text-on-dark-muted)' if loop.parent.loop.index % 3 == 2 else 'var(--text-accent)' }};font-weight:600;">{{ tag }}</span>{% if not loop.last %}<span style="color:var(--text-faint);">·</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
<time datetime="{{ caso.datePublished }}" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:var(--fs-mono-label);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label);color:{{ 'var(--text-on-dark-muted)' if loop.index % 3 == 2 else 'var(--text-faint)' }};white-space:nowrap;">{{ caso.datePublished | replace("-", "/") | truncate(7, true, "") }}</time>
</div>
<div itemprop="name" style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:var(--fs-h2);font-weight:400;line-height:1.25;color:{{ 'var(--bone-100)' if loop.index % 3 == 2 else 'var(--text-strong)' }};margin-bottom:12px;">{{ caso.title }}</div>
<p itemprop="description" style="font-size:var(--fs-body-sm);line-height:1.55;color:{{ 'rgba(241,241,234,0.72)' if loop.index % 3 == 2 else 'var(--text-muted)' }};flex-grow:1;">{{ caso.description | truncate(140) }}</p>
{% if caso.summary %}<div style="margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid {{ 'var(--ink-600)' if loop.index % 3 == 2 else 'var(--border-hairline)' }};padding-top:16px;">{% for item in caso.summary | slice(0, 2) %}<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr;gap:8px;{% if not loop.last %}margin-bottom:8px;{% endif %}"><span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:var(--fs-mono-label);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label);text-transform:uppercase;color:{{ 'var(--text-on-dark-muted)' if loop.parent.loop.index % 3 == 2 else 'var(--text-faint)' }};">{{ item.label }}</span><span style="font-size:var(--fs-body-sm);color:{{ 'var(--bone-200)' if loop.parent.loop.index % 3 == 2 else 'var(--text-strong)' }};line-height:1.35;">{{ item.value | truncate(60) }}</span></div>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}
<div style="margin-top:18px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:var(--fs-mono-label);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-accent);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;">Llegir cas <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></div>
</article>
</a>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
</div>
</section>
<section style="background: var(--surface-tint); border-top: 1px solid var(--oxide-200);">
<div style="max-width: var(--container-wide); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--section-y) var(--gutter); text-align: center;">
<div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:var(--fs-mono-label);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label);text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:var(--fw-medium);color:var(--text-accent);margin-bottom:18px;"><span style="width:24px;height:1.5px;background:var(--accent);display:inline-block;"></span> Sense compromís</div>
<h2 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:var(--fs-h1);font-weight:400;line-height:var(--lh-display);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-tight);color:var(--text-strong);margin:0;">Té un cas similar?</h2>
<p style="margin-top:14px;font-size:var(--fs-lede);line-height:var(--lh-lede);color:var(--text-muted);max-width:60ch;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">Primera consulta sense cost per valorar si el seu cas té recorregut pericial. Resposta en 24 hores.</p>
<div style="margin-top:28px;"><a href="/ca/contacte/professional/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;padding:16px 28px;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--fs-body);font-weight:var(--fw-semibold);line-height:1;letter-spacing:0.005em;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);border:1.5px solid transparent;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-on);text-decoration:none;">Consultar el meu cas <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div>
</div>
</section>
